An analysis file contained multiple alerts that included more related locations than our allowed limit of 10. These alerts correspond to the rules rule-1, rule-2, rule-3 and 1 other rule. Only 10 locations were stored for these alerts.

[Learn more about limits in SARIF uploads](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/code-scanning/integrating-with-code-scanning/sarif-support-for-code-scanning#validating-your-sarif-file).
